<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39977" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιλαγχάνω</span></b> , pf. (v. infr. <i><span class="en">
			11
		</span></i>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>succeed</i> another in an office on a vacancy, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔτε λαχὼν οὔτ᾽ ἐπιλαχών</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
					3.62
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				58.29
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τινὶ</span>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βουλῆς</span>
			<i>succeed</i> him in the Council, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.Com.
				167
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				166.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>.
			<i>obtain</i>, <i>have allotted to one</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐδαιμονίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.629
				</span></i>
			, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>. <i>fall
				to one's</i>
			<i>lot next</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιλέλογχε πύματον . . γῆρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OC</u>
					1235
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιλαχόντα</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὶ πράγματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PMon.</u>
					6.50
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				7.45
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(vi A.D.)</span>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
